Third-party attribution
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The binding surface in `wasi.pr` was generated from the `wasi_snapshot_preview1`
interface definitions (`wasi_preview1.wit`) published by the WebAssembly WASI
Subgroup:

    https://github.com/WebAssembly/WASI

Those interface definitions are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
with LLVM exceptions. The bindings here were produced by `promise bind wit`
(command line: `promise bind wit wasi_preview1.wit -name wasi -target wasi`)
and then polished with inline documentation annotations.

This module reproduces interface names, error codes, and ABI shapes from the
WASI specification for interoperability. Trademarks and project names remain the
property of their respective owners.
